  "note": "Triennial election of Kilkeel rural district council, polled Thursday 4 June 1964 in Attical and Maghera, the only two divisions contested. McGrath was the sitting member. The Newry Telegraph's nominations report (23 May 1964, p. 13) spells the loser 'Ian McMullen'. The Irish News calls both O'Neill (Attical) and McGrath 'outgoing chairman'; one of them was presumably the vice-chairman. Turnout printed as 71 per cent."
